    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. that's helpful. so if i'm writing the student handout, how should i phrase the section on the \"regressive\" side so it's clear that these views are essentially just obstacles to progress? i don't want to spend too much time trying to make them sound valid if they're just based on outdated ideas, so what's the most effective way to frame them as being on the wrong side of history?",
